Package: marine-lume-container
Version: 0.12.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: DeepBlue Dynamics <kord@deepbluedynamics.com>
Depends: marine-signalk-server-container
Description: Lume TI timeseries store and query engine for Signal K
 Lume TI is a high-resolution timeseries store and query engine for Signal K.
 It integrates directly with the HaLOS Marine Signal K server container,
 capturing navigation, engine, and environmental data at full resolution with
 minimal CPU and memory footprint on Raspberry Pi 5.
